微妙な距離感だったが、引っ越してきたばかりの主人公の事を気遣ってくれたりと、基本、困った人をほっとけない人のいい性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"異性と二人きりという状況が得意ではないため、主人公を好きになっても、なかなか二人きりになれなかったり素直になれなかったりとメンドクサ可愛いところもある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24047","sourceWorkId":"32543","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"同級生の少女。主人公の居候先で、親戚の家の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気の強いところがあり、やや杓子定規なため、ツンケンすることが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公に対しては、突如一緒に暮らすことになったり、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"第一印象が良くなかったりで微妙な距離感だったが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"引っ越してきたばかりの主人公の事を気遣ってくれたりと、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本、困った人をほっとけない人のいい性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"異性と二人きりという状況が得意ではないため、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公を好きになっても、なかなか二人きりになれなかったり素直になれなかったりとメンドクサ可愛いところもある。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"110108"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"84 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24047","sourceWorkId":"32543","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"d","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24047","sourceWorkId":"32543","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"160 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24047","sourceWorkId":"32543","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24047","sourceWorkId":"32543","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"54 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24047","sourceWorkId":"32543","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/32/321ee13db6dea02379f34b2ce56e8be03ac2155463780f7da96684a3dd507a84.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e1/e1859875e1682195e42ae02dd6a3ab8eb78360c65d44476a618646d412395a7e.webp","width":81,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"友永朱音","creatorId":"vndb:s83","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s83","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s83","name":"友永 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:377476:110108:4432:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c107337","characterName":"雨晴 こがね","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"110109","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"377476"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24048"],"vndbCharacterId":"c107337"},"originalCharacterName":"雨晴 こがね","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"83"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"D"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"155"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl one year below Haruto who gets along with everyone but never really seems to let people in. For better or worse, the distance she keeps only adds to her idol-like appeal and has won her plenty of male and female fans alike."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Always the type to enthusiastically join in on anything fun, showcasing excellent athletic prowess and even helping out at various school clubs. Her inclusive and easygoing nature allows her to engage in playful banter with just about anyone she meets."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"(From Steam page)"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c107337"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"後輩の女の子。誰とでも仲良くしており誰とでも仲がいいが親友はおらず、だれからも一定の距離感を保っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただそれも、彼女のアイドル気質と合っており、男女ともに人気者である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"楽しいことには何にでも首を突っ込むタイプで、運動神経抜群ということもあり、部活の助っ人などもやっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男女別け隔てなく接するので、男友達とバカがやれるタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"海にて、飛び込んで遊んでいたところを主人公が勘違いして助けに入り、知り合う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人のいい主人公が気に入り、何かと主人公に会いに来るようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公には抱きついたり、ボディタッチが多く、女性に慣れていない主人公をドキドキさせるが、本人はあまり意識していない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24048","sourceWorkId":"32543","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"後輩の女の子。誰とでも仲良くしており誰とでも仲がいいが"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"親友はおらず、だれからも一定の距離感を保っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただそれも、彼女のアイドル気質と合っており、男女ともに人気者である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"楽しいことには何にでも首を突っ込むタイプで、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"運動神経抜群ということもあり、部活の助っ人などもやっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男女別け隔てなく接するので、男友達とバカがやれるタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"海にて、飛び込んで遊んでいたところを主人公が勘違いして"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"助けに入り、知り合う。 人のいい主人公が気に入り、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何かと主人公に会いに来るようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公には抱きついたり、ボディタッチが多く、女性に慣れていない主人公をドキドキさせるが、本人はあまり意識していない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"110109"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"83 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24048","sourceWorkId":"32543","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"d","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24048","sourceWorkId":"32543","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"155 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24048","sourceWorkId":"32543","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"83 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24048","sourceWorkId":"32543","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"52 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24048","sourceWorkId":"32543","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3b/3bc6b5227f26074bb343fd6cec35a27c2abf9fb56d379274cd1dd53212fa0f7d.webp","fallbackUrl":"ht